+## Academic review integration
+
+An optional [academic mode](docs/ACADEMIC.md) adds conservative scientific change checks, original-text fallback and a candidate audit trail. It preserves the exact trained prompt. Profile names label review context; they do not condition the model or guarantee detector outcomes.
